    <div class="card"><div class="icon">📸</div><h3>Photos</h3><p>Photos and creative updates from my journey.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="icon">🌐</div><h3>Official Links</h3><p>Find my social profiles in one place.</p></div>
